{"parse": {"title": "山麓的回音-05", "pageid": 135156, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"width: fit-content; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">结局\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"40px\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-05a\" title=\"山麓的回音-05a\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></td>\n<td>结局Ⅰ：<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>“往维也纳”</b></span><span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（默认结局）</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"40px\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-05b\" title=\"山麓的回音-05b\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></td>\n<td>结局Ⅱ：<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>“回声”</b></span><span style=\"color:#bc9567; font-size:smaller;\">（隐藏结局）</span>\n<ul><li>1-5（即第一层的第五个节点）选择“行至途中”，触发事件“面具之下”。在此选择任一选项获得“锈蚀领结”。</li>\n<li>2-6（即第二层的第六个节点）选择“行至途中”，触发事件“红屋子”。在此选择“前往地下室”获得“神秘的纸箱帽”。</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "山麓的回音-05"}}